<view class="page"><view class="page-header"><text>我的会员卡</text><text>查看次数、有效期和使用记录</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card state-card">正在加载会员卡…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card state-card error-text">{{error}}</view><view wx:elif="{{items.length===0}}" class="card state-card"><text class="empty-title">还没有会员卡</text><text class="muted">购买并支付成功后会自动到账</text><button class="button-primary" bindtap="handleStore">去选购</button></view><view wx:else class="card-list"><view class="member-card status-{{item.status}}" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="handleCard"><view class="card-top"><text class="card-name">{{item.product_name}}</text><text class="status-chip">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><text class="benefit">{{item.benefit}}</text><text class="expiry">{{item.expiryLabel}}</text><view class="card-bottom"><text>卡号 {{item.card_no}}</text><text>查看详情 ›</text></view></view></view></view>
